From: coenttb <coen@coenttb.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 03:43:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] extension file naming: files renamed to the extended
 type's own name or the 'T where <clause>' shape (renames only; Linux x86_64,
 Swift 6.4.2) (coenttb/work#242)

---
 Sources/JSON/{Bool+JSON.swift => Bool.swift}                      | 0
 ... Lexer.Pull.Stream where Tokens == RFC_8259.Pull.Tokens.swift} | 0
 Sources/JSON/{RFC_8259.Value+JSON.swift => RFC_8259.Value.swift}  | 0
 Sources/JSON/{String+JSON.swift => String.swift}                  | 0
 4 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename Sources/JSON/{Bool+JSON.swift => Bool.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/JSON/{JSON.Pull.Stream+Payload.swift => Lexer.Pull.Stream where Tokens == RFC_8259.Pull.Tokens.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/JSON/{RFC_8259.Value+JSON.swift => RFC_8259.Value.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/JSON/{String+JSON.swift => String.swift} (100%)

diff --git a/Sources/JSON/Bool+JSON.swift b/Sources/JSON/Bool.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/JSON/Bool+JSON.swift
rename to Sources/JSON/Bool.swift
diff --git a/Sources/JSON/JSON.Pull.Stream+Payload.swift b/Sources/JSON/Lexer.Pull.Stream where Tokens == RFC_8259.Pull.Tokens.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/JSON/JSON.Pull.Stream+Payload.swift
rename to Sources/JSON/Lexer.Pull.Stream where Tokens == RFC_8259.Pull.Tokens.swift
diff --git a/Sources/JSON/RFC_8259.Value+JSON.swift b/Sources/JSON/RFC_8259.Value.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/JSON/RFC_8259.Value+JSON.swift
rename to Sources/JSON/RFC_8259.Value.swift
diff --git a/Sources/JSON/String+JSON.swift b/Sources/JSON/String.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/JSON/String+JSON.swift
rename to Sources/JSON/String.swift
